[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19683.11, "timestamp": "05:28:03", "text": "一。是啊，看起来很小，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19686.31, "timestamp": "05:28:06", "text": "这种线也会把整个余烬串起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19692.03, "timestamp": "05:28:12", "text": "看起来有点小。所以如果我们选择"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19695.07, "timestamp": "05:28:15", "text": "高，就是这个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19699.39, "timestamp": "05:28:19", "text": "然后我觉得同样的事情又发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19702.23, "timestamp": "05:28:22", "text": "右边那种看起来不错，但是黑色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19706.628, "timestamp": "05:28:26", "text": "对我们来说，边界并不存在，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19709.67, "timestamp": "05:28:29", "text": "如果我们选择中等，我认为中等或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19711.23, "timestamp": "05:28:31", "text": "等等，我做了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19713.99, "timestamp": "05:28:33", "text": "点击？如果我们选择中等价位，结果也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19716.628, "timestamp": "05:28:36", "text": "对吧？黑色瓶子。边界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19720.11, "timestamp": "05:28:40", "text": "不，这个尺寸合适，但是太小了，甚至都穿不下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19721.628, "timestamp": "05:28:41", "text": "读，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19724.99, "timestamp": "05:28:44", "text": "正确的？它太小了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19728.788, "timestamp": "05:28:48", "text": "等待。是啊，字太小了，根本看不清。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19732.23, "timestamp": "05:28:52", "text": "所以这就是为什么我觉得我们……我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19734.83, "timestamp": "05:28:54", "text": "像 Max 那样走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19738.19, "timestamp": "05:28:58", "text": "解决此问题会是更好的办法。所以如果"}]